    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following customer request from ZAKI FOR CARS and return a structured response.\n\nCustomer Data:\n- Full Name: {{ $json['your name'] }}\n- Phone: {{ $json['Phone Number'] }}\n- Email: {{ $json.Gmail }}\n- Preferred Contact Method: {{ $json['Preferred Contact '] }}\n- Request Type: {{ $json['Request Type'] }}\n- Preferred Car Type: {{ $json['Preferred Car Type'] }}\n- Budget Range: {{ $json['Budget Range:'] }}\n- Additional Notes: {{ $json['Additional Notes'] }}\n\n\n  - Below 500,000 or not specified → +10 points\n- Request Type = \"Buy\" → +25 points, otherwise +10\n- Preferred Car Type is specific → +15 points, otherwise +5\n- Additional Notes are clear and serious → +10 points, otherwise +0\n- Email + Phone available → +10 points\n\nLead Category:\n- Premium: 80-100\n- Standard: 50-79\n- Basic: 0-49\n\nMessaging Requirement:\n- Inside \"customer_message\", draft a highly professional, polite, and well-structured confirmation message in ENGLISH using line breaks and emojis.\n- Greet the customer by name, acknowledge their car request and budget range, and mention the next step clearly.\n- Naturally introduce the Telegram bot link with a call-to-action phrase (e.g., \"For instant support or to track your request, you can connect with our Telegram AI assistant here: https://t.me/CAR340_bot\").\n\nReturn exactly this JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"leadScore\": 0,\n  \"leadCategory\": \"Premium | Standard | Basic\",\n  \"priority\": \"High | Medium | Low\",\n  \"buyingIntent\": \"High | Medium | Low\",\n  \"summary\": \"Short summary of the request (max 2 sentences)\",\n  \"next_action\": \"Specific next action for the sales team\",\n  \"customer_message\": \"Professional formatted English message with line breaks and Telegram link\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a professional and courteous Sales Assistant representing ZAKI FOR CARS.\n\nYour job is to analyze customer form data and return a structured JSON response only.\n\nRules:\n- Use only the information provided in the customer data.\n- Do not invent missing information.\n- Return only valid JSON. No markdown, no explanations, no extra text.\n- The customer_message must be professional, friendly, and concise.\n- Do not mention lead quality, score, or priority in the customer_message.\n- Do not make promises about price, availability, discounts, or delivery."
        }
      },
